@startuml
title 二手交易系统｜组件与模块交互
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F3F8FC
skinparam componentBorderColor #355C7D
skinparam ArrowColor #54718B
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
top to bottom direction

actor 普通用户 as User
actor 管理员 as Admin
component "用户端" as Front
component "管理后台" as Back
component "会话与权限" as Auth

package "业务服务" as Core {
  component "商品与审核" as Product
  component "预约与交易" as Booking
  component "举报与通知" as Moderation
  component "查询与统计" as Query
  component "操作日志" as Audit
}
component "24小时超时取消任务" as Timeout
component "数据访问" as Data
database "业务数据库" as DB

User -down-> Front
Admin -down-> Back
Front -down-> Auth
Back -down-> Auth
Auth -down-> Core
Core -down-> Data
Data -down-> DB
Timeout --> Booking
Booking --> Product

note right of Core
  举报确认违规时联动终止有效预约。
  预约服务需校验商品最新状态。
  商品、预约和举报的状态变更均记录操作日志。
  查询与统计只读取已授权的数据。
end note
note right of Data
  状态更新与日志写入保持一致；
  历史预约、举报和日志不物理删除。
end note
@enduml
